# No trailing slashes on directory names (M0-SH-05, D-018): a `foo/` pattern
# matches only real directories, so a symlinked node_modules/dist (pnpm and
# turbo both create them) would slip through and get committed. Two
# implementers hit exactly that.
node_modules
dist
.turbo
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
